+      bool on_caret = false;
+#if BUILDFLAG(IS_OHOS)
+      // On a phone the caret itself is what people press and drag to move
+      // it, as in any HarmonyOS text field; the handle below it is easy to
+      // miss. For the insertion handle only, a touch on the caret line --
+      // within a touch radius of it, between its top and bottom -- counts
+      // as a touch on the handle. Selection handles keep the rule below, so
